			<p style="margin: 0px 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">President, Chief Executive Officer &amp; Chief Financial Officer</p>
			</td>
			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 8%;" valign="top">
