			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">monitoring our internal control over financial reporting, disclosure controls and procedures and code of business conduct and ethics;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

