			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">oversight of our cybersecurity risk management program, as delegated by our Board of Directors;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

