			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:solid 1px #000000;vertical-align:bottom;width:1%;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:solid 1px #000000;vertical-align:bottom;width:10.8%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>Compensation Actually Paid to PEO </b></p>

